Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:43:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add standalone MMB4W Emulator desktop preview

Build MMB4W-Emulator.exe in emulator/ with native desktop menus, configurable input, portable settings, display/audio controls and screenshots. Include runtime fixes, build/package tooling, native checks and six BASIC regression probes.

Publish emulator-only packages with source, attribution and third-party notices. Use a Windows-native BMP adapter; exclude the original embedded BMP decoder and separately licensed turtle engine from the preview binary. TURTLE reports a recoverable unsupported-command error.

Based on UKTailwind/MMB4W b1a0586a6559e7b29b5f71ee411798f03d55fbae (5.07.03b20).
